WEBVTT

01:44.920 --> 01:47.160
Is this related to the thunder?

01:47.680 --> 01:49.640
It interfered with the signal?

01:52.000 --> 01:53.840
How can I face people like this?

02:11.960 --> 02:14.760
Have you contacted Su Miao
through Su Chengcheng?

02:29.280 --> 02:30.360
ER GUAN

02:37.960 --> 02:39.160
ER GUAN

03:13.840 --> 03:15.960
How is my face now?

03:18.480 --> 03:22.200
Is it good-looking or not?

03:24.960 --> 03:26.320
You're pretty.

03:33.680 --> 03:35.040
I'm Su Miao.

03:36.680 --> 03:38.600
How did you end up here?

03:44.760 --> 03:45.920
Su Miao.

03:47.800 --> 03:49.120
Why…

04:14.400 --> 04:15.640
Don't turn on the light.

04:18.279 --> 04:20.120
No, no.

04:21.560 --> 04:22.400
This…

04:22.920 --> 04:24.080
This is…

04:25.400 --> 04:26.960
moving too fast.

04:30.480 --> 04:32.880
We should talk about it.

04:52.200 --> 04:54.000
What do you want to talk about?

04:54.080 --> 04:54.960
Well…

04:57.480 --> 04:58.920
No, we can't do this.

04:59.960 --> 05:04.040
I'm conservative
when it comes to relationships.

05:04.640 --> 05:07.000
I don't accept
purely physical relationships.

05:07.640 --> 05:08.480
I…

05:09.320 --> 05:10.160
I…

05:11.160 --> 05:12.200
You…

05:12.280 --> 05:14.840
Let go of me now.

05:16.760 --> 05:18.080
Let go of me, Su Miao.

05:18.160 --> 05:20.480
Let go of me. Let go of me, Su Miao.

05:21.320 --> 05:22.760
Su Miao. You…

05:27.520 --> 05:29.760
Why do you need to meet me
to return the money?

05:29.840 --> 05:31.880
I've deleted all your photos.

05:32.600 --> 05:33.480
Besides that,

05:33.560 --> 05:35.680
I also want to officially apologize
for what happened last night.

05:36.360 --> 05:37.640
Sorry for causing you trouble.

05:38.640 --> 05:41.280
Thank you for not leaving me
by the roadside last night.

05:43.720 --> 05:47.240
Is this a cheesy handwritten
thank-you card?

05:50.040 --> 05:51.920
This is a year's car wash card.

05:52.560 --> 05:54.120
A small gesture to show my gratitude.

05:54.200 --> 05:55.120
Thank you.

06:04.360 --> 06:05.360
Who's there?

06:22.840 --> 06:23.680
Sorry.

06:24.560 --> 06:26.560
Are you okay? Where are you hurt?

06:28.040 --> 06:29.280
My butt.

06:31.960 --> 06:33.080
Are you okay?

06:33.160 --> 06:35.080
- Where are you hurt?
- Ow, ow, ow.

06:35.600 --> 06:39.440
I'm fine.
But I ended up as a human cushion.

06:39.520 --> 06:41.560
It hurts, but I'm not injured.

06:41.640 --> 06:42.720
Is it serious?

06:42.800 --> 06:43.960
Su Miao?

06:44.880 --> 06:47.280
- What are you doing here?
- She's my best friend.

06:47.360 --> 06:48.840
Why can't she be here?

06:54.960 --> 06:57.440
Do you know him?

06:59.520 --> 07:00.720
Let's talk about it later.

07:02.440 --> 07:03.320
Be gentle.

07:05.080 --> 07:07.080
- Slow down.
- Goodbye.

07:08.400 --> 07:10.280
Slow down.

07:15.360 --> 07:16.200
Slow down, slow down.

07:16.280 --> 07:17.800
What a coincidence.

07:19.160 --> 07:20.680
- Here.
- It's fine. You can manage.

07:20.760 --> 07:22.240
OK. Sit.

07:22.880 --> 07:23.800
Slow down.

07:24.840 --> 07:25.800
Are you okay?

07:26.320 --> 07:27.280
- Are you okay? Let me see.
- I'm fine.

07:27.360 --> 07:30.560
What about you?
How did you turn into Su Miao again?

07:30.640 --> 07:32.240
Why dress like this?

07:36.400 --> 07:38.440
- My face can't change back.
- What?

07:41.040 --> 07:41.880
It can't go back?

07:43.880 --> 07:44.920
What exactly happened?

07:50.120 --> 07:53.920
When I was working overtime,
the filter suddenly became unstable.

07:54.000 --> 07:55.800
It turned me into Su Miao.

07:55.880 --> 07:57.480
Now it's stuck on the upgrading interface.

07:57.560 --> 07:58.560
I can't use it at all.

07:59.840 --> 08:01.880
The system is upgrading.

08:01.960 --> 08:03.440
That should be like a computer.

08:03.960 --> 08:06.200
Once the upgrade is done,
it'll go back to normal.

08:08.200 --> 08:09.600
I hope so.

08:11.520 --> 08:13.920
How much has the filter been upgraded?

08:14.000 --> 08:15.080
How much longer until it's done?

08:15.720 --> 08:18.120
It's been two hours. Only 3% complete.

08:21.640 --> 08:23.200
It's fine.

08:23.280 --> 08:25.520
As long as there's progress, it's good.

08:25.600 --> 08:27.240
If not, you just need to wait longer.

08:33.559 --> 08:35.960
I won't be able to go home tonight.

08:36.039 --> 08:38.480
I'll have to stay at your place.

08:39.840 --> 08:41.200
Don't worry.

08:41.280 --> 08:43.679
I'll take care of you.

08:45.800 --> 08:47.680
Go wash some fruit.

08:48.600 --> 08:51.360
Can you tell us the whole story?

08:51.440 --> 08:53.960
I met this netizen six months ago.

08:54.040 --> 08:55.960
At first, we got along well.

08:56.040 --> 08:57.880
We had many common interests.

08:58.400 --> 08:59.640
Chengcheng just messaged me.

08:59.720 --> 09:00.920
She said she won't be coming back today.

09:01.000 --> 09:02.240
She's staying at Yuan's place.

09:02.320 --> 09:03.600
Not coming back again?

09:04.200 --> 09:05.240
OK, got it.

09:05.320 --> 09:07.840
His personality was easy
to get along with.

09:07.920 --> 09:09.760
He treated me to malatang

09:09.840 --> 09:11.080
and said we should go see a movie.

09:11.160 --> 09:14.360
Girls should be more cautious
when they're outside.

09:14.960 --> 09:16.560
They should know
how to protect themselves.

09:16.640 --> 09:19.320
How careless her parents are.

09:19.400 --> 09:21.680
They should be worried
when their daughter comes back so late.

09:21.760 --> 09:22.800
Yeah.

09:22.880 --> 09:25.160
Su Chengcheng is lying.
She's not at Lin Yuan's place.

09:25.760 --> 09:27.040
Then, where is she?

09:27.120 --> 09:28.280
What's going on?

09:28.840 --> 09:31.000
She didn't come home last night either.

09:31.080 --> 09:32.360
I just messaged her on WeChat.

09:32.440 --> 09:34.360
She said she was
at Lin Yuan's place last night.

09:35.040 --> 09:36.440
I saw her this morning.

09:36.520 --> 09:39.400
I'm 100% sure
she's using Lin Yuan as a shield.

09:41.440 --> 09:42.520
What about you?

09:42.600 --> 09:43.800
When you started to date,

09:43.880 --> 09:46.440
weren't you also hiding it from us,
using your best friend as a shield?

09:46.520 --> 09:47.360
But what was the truth?

09:47.440 --> 09:49.840
I'm much smarter.
Can Su Chengcheng compare with me?

09:50.960 --> 09:53.640
Who just said
girls should protect themselves?

09:55.240 --> 09:58.840
Well, Chengcheng
doesn't compare IQ with others.

09:59.960 --> 10:03.160
If someone is unethical
and dares to hurt her…

10:04.480 --> 10:07.080
Just watch. They'll definitely lose.

10:11.360 --> 10:15.800
UPGRADING

10:20.480 --> 10:22.040
How much has it been upgraded?

10:22.680 --> 10:24.040
4%.

10:24.120 --> 10:26.600
Staring harder won't help.

10:26.680 --> 10:27.520
Stop looking.

11:05.560 --> 11:07.760
Isn't it nice being a beauty?

11:12.880 --> 11:15.560
Sometimes yes, sometimes no.

11:16.120 --> 11:17.720
Sometimes it feels really great.

11:18.360 --> 11:21.680
People are friendlier.
There are more opportunities.

11:22.200 --> 11:24.720
It's like fate suddenly favored me.

11:24.800 --> 11:26.760
The whole world is nicer to me.

11:27.800 --> 11:31.440
But sometimes, I feel guilty and uneasy.

11:32.200 --> 11:34.120
Even if everyone likes me,

11:34.200 --> 11:37.680
I know deep down
they don't like the actual me.

11:38.280 --> 11:41.000
I didn't understand people
who are addicted to plastic surgery,

11:41.080 --> 11:42.640
but now I sort of get it.

11:43.320 --> 11:45.640
They're afraid
that everything gained from looks

11:45.720 --> 11:47.240
might suddenly disappear.

11:47.320 --> 11:48.440
The more guilty and uneasy they feel,

11:48.520 --> 11:50.000
the more they have to grab
onto it tightly.

11:51.240 --> 11:54.040
The legs and feet determine the speed,

11:54.120 --> 11:56.600
the organs determine the health,

11:56.680 --> 11:59.080
the hands do the labor,
and the brain is the boss.

11:59.160 --> 12:02.320
To survive in nature's
survival of the fittest,

12:02.400 --> 12:03.480
all are indispensable.

12:04.000 --> 12:04.880
Except for the face.

12:05.400 --> 12:07.560
Whether it's good-looking or not,

12:07.640 --> 12:08.880
it's irrelevant to survival.

12:08.960 --> 12:11.560
So, why do we care so much?

12:12.080 --> 12:14.560
Some even say looks are productivity.

12:14.640 --> 12:17.440
Can looks produce food or clothes?

12:18.040 --> 12:20.320
Looks indeed are productivity.

12:20.400 --> 12:23.480
Good-looking people
can promote reproduction,

12:23.560 --> 12:25.200
producing more people.

12:25.920 --> 12:28.720
Su Chengcheng,
your mindset really surprises me.

12:28.800 --> 12:31.200
I had a crush on Tang Qi
in the first place

12:31.280 --> 12:33.440
because of his face, right?

12:33.520 --> 12:36.160
It was supposed to be
a pure campus romance,

12:36.240 --> 12:38.600
but after what you said, it's all changed.

15:00.040 --> 15:01.320
Don't turn on the light.

15:23.160 --> 15:25.840
The subscriber you dialed
is currently unavailable.

15:25.920 --> 15:27.880
Please try again later.

15:31.560 --> 15:34.560
I thought I was the earliest today,
but you're even earlier.

15:35.240 --> 15:37.640
I stayed at the office.
I didn't go back last night.

15:38.520 --> 15:40.240
You worked overnight?

15:40.320 --> 15:44.040
Tang Qi, are you working so hard
to take my shares?

15:45.120 --> 15:45.960
Do you think…

15:49.840 --> 15:51.000
What do you mean?

15:55.400 --> 15:56.960
If a woman

15:58.240 --> 15:59.920
hugs and holds you

16:00.560 --> 16:01.920
but refuses to turn on the light,

16:03.600 --> 16:04.840
what does that mean?

16:08.640 --> 16:11.320
Are you saying Su Miao
hugged and held you?

16:13.800 --> 16:15.040
Forget I asked.

16:15.640 --> 16:18.600
If a woman hugs and holds me

16:18.680 --> 16:20.120
but refuses to turn on the light,

16:20.680 --> 16:24.520
it definitely means she likes me.

16:33.160 --> 16:34.360
But she…

16:37.080 --> 16:38.600
She knocked you out.

16:39.200 --> 16:40.120
She knocked me out?

16:43.480 --> 16:47.120
Are you sure it wasn't me
who hugged and held her first?

16:47.200 --> 16:49.400
I'm sure. She made the first move.

16:55.280 --> 16:56.640
Who's there?

16:59.800 --> 17:04.079
There must be something we don't know.

17:25.560 --> 17:27.319
Why are you awake so early?

17:27.880 --> 17:30.000
How much has the filter been upgraded?

17:30.880 --> 17:32.080
Twenty-five percent.

17:34.360 --> 17:36.680
How am I supposed to go to work today?

17:47.560 --> 17:49.480
Mr. Gu agreed that I could work from home.

17:50.200 --> 17:51.960
I didn't expect the man
who threw up in my car

17:52.040 --> 17:53.560
would be your boss.

17:54.160 --> 17:55.960
Should I return the car wash card to him?

17:57.320 --> 17:58.640
No need. Mr. Gu is a great guy.

17:58.720 --> 18:00.480
He wouldn't care about trifles like this.

18:00.560 --> 18:03.520
The man I don't get along with is Tang Qi.

18:08.120 --> 18:09.600
When the filter malfunctioned last night,

18:09.680 --> 18:10.720
Tang Qi was right there.

18:11.960 --> 18:14.000
In my panic,

18:15.200 --> 18:16.240
I knocked him out.

18:18.520 --> 18:20.120
You knocked out Tang Qi?

18:30.760 --> 18:32.120
Chengcheng, come here.

18:34.040 --> 18:35.280
What's going on?

18:35.360 --> 18:36.440
What happened?

18:37.080 --> 18:38.600
Why is Tang Qi here?

18:38.680 --> 18:41.760
Did he see your face change last night?

18:49.400 --> 18:52.960
- What are you doing here so early?
- I'm looking for Su Miao.

18:53.040 --> 18:55.400
This is my home, Lin Yuan's home.

18:55.480 --> 18:56.480
You've got the wrong place.

19:07.120 --> 19:08.840
You really got the wrong place.

19:08.920 --> 19:10.400
Su Miao isn't here.

19:10.920 --> 19:11.880
Gu Yu told me

19:11.960 --> 19:13.680
Su Miao came here last night.

19:14.520 --> 19:15.960
If it's inconvenient for me to go in,

19:16.560 --> 19:17.840
I can wait outside.

19:18.440 --> 19:19.280
I can wait forever.

19:26.840 --> 19:29.400
He said he could wait forever.

19:29.480 --> 19:31.600
Is Mr. Gu a plague?

19:31.680 --> 19:33.080
Whenever he shows up,
nothing good happens.

19:34.680 --> 19:35.720
Let Tang Qi in.

19:56.840 --> 19:58.640
I have things to do. You two chat.

20:03.040 --> 20:03.880
Please have a seat.

20:14.200 --> 20:15.440
Last night,

20:16.400 --> 20:19.360
was it you in the warehouse?

20:21.000 --> 20:22.440
What do you mean by that?

20:22.520 --> 20:24.680
Who else could it be if not me?

20:27.640 --> 20:28.640
Last night,

20:29.760 --> 20:30.880
did you drink?

20:31.400 --> 20:32.240
Were you drunk?

20:32.840 --> 20:35.440
I drank? I got drunk?

20:36.320 --> 20:37.320
Why ask that?

20:38.680 --> 20:41.240
I've been thinking
about why you'd do that.

20:41.760 --> 20:45.120
The only explanation
is that you were drunk.

20:47.200 --> 20:52.640
Then what did Su Miao do
when she was drunk?

21:10.200 --> 21:11.320
This?

21:12.560 --> 21:14.800
Did you come here just to ask this?

21:16.920 --> 21:18.240
I want to know

21:19.360 --> 21:20.680
if you meant it last night.

21:20.760 --> 21:22.920
No. I didn't mean it.

21:23.960 --> 21:25.920
- I was drunk.
- I didn't smell alcohol on you.

21:28.920 --> 21:32.560
The alcohol was inside my body.

21:32.640 --> 21:35.080
It didn't dissipate,
but my head was already spinning.

21:35.160 --> 21:36.960
I was disoriented and confused.

21:37.040 --> 21:39.000
Why did you knock me out?

21:41.400 --> 21:43.880
It wasn't me. Definitely not me.

21:43.960 --> 21:46.720
It was the cosmetics
on the shelf that fell down

21:46.800 --> 21:48.560
and hit you, knocking you out.

21:48.640 --> 21:50.440
I'm not blaming you.

21:50.960 --> 21:51.800
I just…

22:01.000 --> 22:03.400
It's already past eight.

22:03.480 --> 22:05.080
I need to go to work.

22:05.160 --> 22:06.280
You should go back to work too.

22:06.360 --> 22:07.400
I'll walk you out.

22:09.640 --> 22:10.720
I'd like to invite you to dinner tonight.

22:12.760 --> 22:14.240
Why?

22:14.320 --> 22:16.320
You invited me to dinner last time,

22:16.400 --> 22:17.520
and I haven't returned the favor.

22:19.320 --> 22:20.600
Beef brisket, lamb intestines.

22:23.560 --> 22:24.680
No need, no need.

22:24.760 --> 22:26.560
It was a food stall. It didn't cost much.

22:29.640 --> 22:31.440
Last time, when I was drunk,

22:31.960 --> 22:34.680
you took me home,
and I didn't thank you properly.

22:40.680 --> 22:42.720
No need, no need. It's nothing, really.

22:44.880 --> 22:46.480
There are some things
I need to say to you face to face.

22:47.080 --> 22:48.120
I can't keep being vague about it.

22:50.320 --> 22:51.160
Go ahead.

22:52.120 --> 22:53.720
The time and place aren't right.

22:54.480 --> 22:55.840
Aren't you in a hurry to go to work?

22:58.440 --> 22:59.840
Tonight at 7.

23:00.640 --> 23:01.480
I'll pick you up.

23:08.000 --> 23:10.480
Send me the address. I'll come on my own.

23:23.000 --> 23:25.240
Su Chengcheng seems strong,

23:25.320 --> 23:26.960
but she's sick every now and then.

23:27.040 --> 23:29.000
I am sure that it's a lie.

23:29.080 --> 23:32.240
You're unlucky to be her teammate.

23:33.280 --> 23:34.840
You've got good luck, huh?

23:34.920 --> 23:35.800
I didn't expect to be…

23:52.720 --> 23:54.440
What's there to fear?

23:54.520 --> 23:57.120
We should let the bosses know
Su Chengcheng's true nature.

23:59.400 --> 24:00.480
Here's the info you wanted.

24:01.000 --> 24:01.960
Thanks.

24:03.600 --> 24:04.600
Where's Su Chengcheng?

24:05.120 --> 24:07.280
She applied to work from home
because she's sick.

24:07.800 --> 24:10.000
Do you need something from her?

24:11.040 --> 24:12.160
Nothing.

24:12.240 --> 24:13.480
I saw her working overtime last night,

24:13.560 --> 24:14.960
so I thought she'd changed,

24:15.480 --> 24:17.240
- but I didn't expect it…
- What didn't you expect?

24:19.480 --> 24:21.960
Is there a misunderstanding
between you and Su Chengcheng?

24:23.760 --> 24:26.120
I didn't expect
that she was friends with Su Miao.

24:27.840 --> 24:29.440
That's true.

24:30.040 --> 24:31.320
Did you meet Su Miao?

24:31.400 --> 24:33.480
I did. We're having dinner tonight.

24:34.320 --> 24:35.680
Congratulations.

24:36.320 --> 24:37.960
You should thank me for this.

24:38.040 --> 24:39.000
I don't want a pricey gift.

24:39.080 --> 24:40.880
Just buy me a gift worth a thousand

24:40.960 --> 24:44.040
and reimburse me for the car wash card
I gave to Lin Yuan.

24:44.640 --> 24:46.560
Don't be so stingy.

24:50.640 --> 24:51.640
TANG QI

24:52.920 --> 24:55.880
Information fee.
Thanks for telling me where Su Miao is.

25:01.120 --> 25:02.000
No problem.

25:06.560 --> 25:08.960
Lately, my luck has been pretty good.

25:12.400 --> 25:13.840
Shun.

25:14.360 --> 25:16.440
I've been a little unlucky lately.

25:16.520 --> 25:18.360
You've got to help me out.

25:21.000 --> 25:23.960
Only Mr. Tang has detailed data.

25:24.040 --> 25:25.600
Sorry, I can't help you.

25:26.120 --> 25:27.320
By the way,

25:27.400 --> 25:29.600
let's each do our part of the proposal

25:29.680 --> 25:30.680
and present it separately.

25:30.760 --> 25:33.160
I didn't even consider working with you.

25:37.280 --> 25:39.240
Why the long face?

25:39.320 --> 25:41.280
I'm writing a proposal,

25:41.840 --> 25:43.680
and I need some product data.

25:43.760 --> 25:45.040
Why don't you ask a colleague?

25:45.120 --> 25:46.600
I did.

25:47.200 --> 25:50.800
Xu Yue said
that only Tang Qi has the data.

25:50.880 --> 25:52.240
Go ask Tang Qi for it.

25:52.960 --> 25:55.360
Tang Qi doesn't like me.

25:55.880 --> 25:57.480
Will he even give it to me?

25:57.560 --> 26:00.000
This is work. He won't be unreasonable.

26:14.560 --> 26:15.760
Mr. Tang, hello.

26:15.840 --> 26:17.440
I'm working on a marketing proposal.

26:17.520 --> 26:19.840
I need the latest test data
for Starlight Eyeshadow.

26:19.920 --> 26:21.240
Could you send me a copy?

26:21.320 --> 26:23.720
This data is crucial for me
to finish the proposal.

26:23.800 --> 26:24.800
Sorry to trouble you.

26:30.640 --> 26:31.440
SWIPE UP TO UNLOCK

26:37.760 --> 26:38.680
SWIPE UP TO UNLOCK

26:40.720 --> 26:42.040
It's been 20 minutes.

26:42.560 --> 26:44.080
He hasn't responded at all.

26:46.640 --> 26:49.000
Why don't you just call him?

26:49.080 --> 26:52.000
Maybe Tang Qi's busy
and didn't see your message.

27:02.280 --> 27:03.480
ANGEL SU

27:03.560 --> 27:04.720
Are you busy?

27:11.600 --> 27:12.640
Look, look.

27:13.840 --> 27:15.480
No. What do you need?

27:16.080 --> 27:17.440
How annoying!

27:20.600 --> 27:21.960
NO. WHAT DO YOU NEED?

27:30.000 --> 27:32.240
ANGEL SU

27:34.080 --> 27:35.320
ER GUAN

27:44.920 --> 27:45.920
What are you doing?

27:49.440 --> 27:51.280
I can't take the call now.

27:51.360 --> 27:52.720
Just wanted to remind you

27:52.800 --> 27:54.400
to not be late tonight.

27:58.400 --> 27:59.520
Sure.

28:01.800 --> 28:04.520
Su Chengcheng and I are close…

28:07.240 --> 28:08.600
You should…

28:10.400 --> 28:12.840
Su ChengCheng and I are close friends.

28:16.880 --> 28:18.840
I don't need Tang Qi's help.

28:20.120 --> 28:22.880
It should've gone well with your filter.

28:22.960 --> 28:25.400
Why do you have to go down
a bitter, motivational path?

28:31.520 --> 28:32.440
Come in.

28:33.400 --> 28:35.200
Sorry, Mr. Tang, for delaying your work.

28:35.280 --> 28:36.320
Please try again.

28:36.400 --> 28:37.760
The internet should be working now.

28:43.120 --> 28:45.040
- It's working, thanks.
- Good.

28:48.840 --> 28:50.320
The file has been sent to your email.

28:52.360 --> 28:53.520
TANG QI

28:53.600 --> 28:55.040
TEST DATA OF STARLIGHT EYESHADOW

29:05.760 --> 29:09.080
Su Miao mentioned it,
and Tang Qi sent over the file.

29:10.080 --> 29:12.160
You'll use this data, right?

29:12.240 --> 29:13.680
Of course.

29:14.240 --> 29:16.840
Tang Qi is not a big deal.
I won't ruin my work because of him.

29:16.920 --> 29:19.160
Work is a woman's biggest support.

29:31.480 --> 29:32.520
The rest is up to you.

29:33.200 --> 29:34.040
Sure.

29:36.680 --> 29:39.040
I have a date tonight,
so I need to leave work early.

29:43.080 --> 29:44.320
A date?

29:44.840 --> 29:47.000
With a woman?

29:47.080 --> 29:48.720
Not a work date?

29:49.680 --> 29:52.040
That should not be your focus.
It's bad for the research.

29:54.840 --> 29:56.440
STARLIGHT EYESHADOW PROPOSAL

30:00.320 --> 30:01.800
It's finally done.

30:01.880 --> 30:03.400
How much has the filter been upgraded?

30:06.560 --> 30:08.040
49% now.

30:09.200 --> 30:12.160
It started around 7 or 8 last night.

30:12.800 --> 30:16.560
By a little past six today,
it's almost half done.

30:16.640 --> 30:19.360
At this speed,
it'll be done by tomorrow night.

30:19.440 --> 30:20.800
You can go back to work
the day after tomorrow.

30:20.880 --> 30:21.960
Are you happy about it?

30:23.280 --> 30:25.040
I'll still need to take leave tomorrow.

30:28.400 --> 30:29.360
You can work from home.

30:29.960 --> 30:31.360
Look, I work from home every day,

30:31.440 --> 30:33.640
and I'm still a best-selling comic artist.

30:33.720 --> 30:37.480
But I need to present the proposal

30:37.560 --> 30:39.320
to the bosses tomorrow.

30:40.680 --> 30:42.320
That's too bad.

30:48.680 --> 30:49.880
It's okay.

30:49.960 --> 30:52.720
I can send the proposal
to Xu Yue from my team

30:52.800 --> 30:54.720
and have her help me
with the presentation.

30:55.280 --> 30:56.280
Exactly.

30:58.440 --> 31:00.640
It's almost time. We should head out.

31:02.880 --> 31:05.840
- Where are we going?
- Tang Qi, seven o'clock.

31:18.840 --> 31:20.440
How much has the filter been upgraded?

31:20.520 --> 31:21.640
Fifty percent.

31:21.720 --> 31:24.320
Even if you eat for two hours,
that's more than enough.

31:25.920 --> 31:27.360
Two hours?

31:27.440 --> 31:29.480
I don't actually want to eat with him.

31:29.560 --> 31:30.400
Half an hour at most.

31:31.480 --> 31:33.760
Good luck getting rid of Tang Qi quickly.

31:34.600 --> 31:36.520
I will. Bye.

31:52.360 --> 31:54.040
Aren't we supposed to eat?

31:54.120 --> 31:55.880
Why did it turn into a lake trip?

31:57.560 --> 31:59.120
We can eat

31:59.880 --> 32:01.120
while enjoying the view.

32:02.400 --> 32:04.480
This meal definitely isn't cheap.

32:05.520 --> 32:07.800
Tell me the truth.
What do you really want to do?

32:08.800 --> 32:11.160
Shooting a poster was my bottom line.

32:11.240 --> 32:14.680
I will never help you
with some other promotion event.

32:18.400 --> 32:20.760
I promise that it's not about work.

32:22.080 --> 32:23.560
It's just a private dinner.

32:27.280 --> 32:29.280
Such a big setup

32:29.360 --> 32:31.200
for a simple meal?

32:32.200 --> 32:33.640
Do you think I'm a fool?

32:34.680 --> 32:36.600
Unless you explain it,

32:36.680 --> 32:38.320
I won't take a single bite.

32:44.000 --> 32:44.840
OK.

32:46.000 --> 32:48.800
I'll explain it.

32:57.320 --> 32:59.160
I had arranged with the waiter

33:00.120 --> 33:02.160
to light these candles secretly

33:03.120 --> 33:04.640
while we enjoyed the view.

33:06.280 --> 33:07.880
Now, I'll have to light them myself.

33:08.720 --> 33:10.120
Why light the candles?

33:14.200 --> 33:15.040
For you.

33:20.680 --> 33:21.840
For me?

33:42.040 --> 33:42.920
Tang Qi,

33:43.440 --> 33:46.040
I lit these candles just for you.

33:50.040 --> 33:51.120
Thank you.

33:58.200 --> 34:00.600
Alright. The candles are all lit.

34:01.440 --> 34:03.040
Now, can you explain it?

34:21.679 --> 34:22.679
Su Miao,

34:26.639 --> 34:27.760
what do you think of me?

34:29.679 --> 34:31.120
First, you're not my boss.

34:31.199 --> 34:32.760
Second, you're not my boyfriend.

34:32.840 --> 34:34.719
You simply don't matter--

34:45.040 --> 34:46.480
Is Tang Qi about to confess?

34:55.360 --> 34:57.360
UPGRADING

35:04.520 --> 35:05.880
The first time I saw you

35:08.520 --> 35:09.480
on the street,

35:16.800 --> 35:18.080
we met by chance,

35:20.160 --> 35:21.640
and I was smitten.

35:23.520 --> 35:24.480
The second time I saw you

35:29.120 --> 35:30.240
at the company,

35:35.240 --> 35:36.360
when you walked towards me,

35:38.680 --> 35:40.320
I finally realized

35:41.840 --> 35:46.000
that I'd found my iridescent one.

35:53.080 --> 35:53.960
Su Miao,

35:57.000 --> 35:58.200
I fell for you at first sight

35:59.480 --> 36:00.800
and became deeply infatuated
the second time.

36:03.240 --> 36:04.320
If…

36:07.520 --> 36:09.400
If you haven't fallen for someone,

36:11.920 --> 36:13.200
could you consider me?

36:15.240 --> 36:16.880
Will you be my girlfriend?

36:21.120 --> 36:22.040
Su Miao.

36:23.800 --> 36:25.000
Su Miao!

36:30.880 --> 36:31.800
Su Miao!

36:48.640 --> 36:49.480
Su Miao!

36:56.120 --> 36:57.040
Su Miao!

37:03.360 --> 37:04.200
Su Miao!

37:34.480 --> 37:36.920
The rain hasn't started.
How come you're so wet already?

37:38.920 --> 37:39.960
The filter…

37:40.880 --> 37:42.040
The filter is malfunctioning again.

37:42.800 --> 37:45.480
Hurry and drive. Tang Qi might catch up.

38:34.840 --> 38:37.640
ER GUAN

38:39.520 --> 38:42.080
Are you saying
the filter is unstable again?

38:42.160 --> 38:43.360
That's why your face keeps changing?

38:44.200 --> 38:45.440
What's going on?

38:45.520 --> 38:46.360
UPGRADING

38:47.080 --> 38:48.840
I think it's about the weather.

38:59.040 --> 39:01.000
It changed. Your face is changing.

39:01.080 --> 39:02.040
Look.

39:05.600 --> 39:07.280
Looks like my guess was right.

39:07.800 --> 39:10.080
The filter is unstable while upgrading.

39:10.160 --> 39:13.400
When there's a thunderstorm,
my face becomes unstable too.

39:28.680 --> 39:30.640
Seems it's not the rain

39:30.720 --> 39:32.360
but the thunder that affects it.

39:33.720 --> 39:36.280
No wonder in novels,
demons go through thunder tribulations

39:36.360 --> 39:37.840
but never rain tribulations.

39:37.920 --> 39:39.240
So, that's how it works.

39:41.960 --> 39:43.000
Don't worry.

39:43.080 --> 39:44.880
After going through tribulations,
you'll become stronger.

39:44.960 --> 39:48.160
Once your system is upgraded,
it'll definitely become stronger.

40:07.440 --> 40:09.160
How much has the filter been upgraded?

40:12.480 --> 40:13.600
UPGRADING

40:13.680 --> 40:14.920
Only 53%.

40:15.600 --> 40:17.280
It should be done by tomorrow night.

40:25.680 --> 40:28.520
When you were showering,
I heard the phone vibrating non-stop.

40:28.600 --> 40:30.080
I picked it up

40:30.160 --> 40:32.840
and saw that Tang Qi had called Su Miao
dozens of times.

40:40.280 --> 40:43.400
ER GUAN

40:44.760 --> 40:45.760
TURN OFF

40:45.840 --> 40:46.960
CLICK TO TURN OFF

40:51.640 --> 40:53.000
Before I jumped into the lake,

40:53.080 --> 40:55.040
I heard Tang Qi confess to Su Miao.

40:57.000 --> 40:57.840
Tang Qi?

40:59.200 --> 41:00.160
Confess?

41:02.360 --> 41:03.360
Is it

41:04.280 --> 41:07.280
a romantic confession?

41:07.360 --> 41:10.160
Of course. What else could it be?

41:11.160 --> 41:12.800
Tell me. How did Tang Qi confess?

41:16.880 --> 41:19.080
They were on a boat.

41:19.920 --> 41:24.040
He set up candles and flowers, and…

41:26.640 --> 41:29.800
Anyway, it was cheesy,
just like the scenes on TV.

41:30.600 --> 41:32.400
Oh my God.

41:32.920 --> 41:35.240
No wonder you were so mad
and jumped into the lake.

41:36.960 --> 41:39.480
I jumped
because of the filter malfunction.

41:40.360 --> 41:41.520
I believe you.

41:42.960 --> 41:45.720
He said he'd only love her.

41:46.440 --> 41:48.040
How long has he even known Su Miao

41:48.120 --> 41:49.760
and he's so sure about her?

41:51.080 --> 41:53.760
What's so good about Su Miao?

41:55.760 --> 41:57.600
When I was Su Chengcheng,

41:57.680 --> 41:59.800
he never even looked at me properly.

42:00.880 --> 42:02.520
How long has Su Miao known him

42:02.600 --> 42:03.960
and he already confessed?

42:04.480 --> 42:06.320
That's because of Su Miao's face, right?

42:08.000 --> 42:10.160
It's not worth getting mad at that jerk.

42:11.960 --> 42:13.760
Eat. It's all yours.

42:36.040 --> 42:38.960
Why is Tang Qi everywhere?

42:41.080 --> 42:43.200
Stay inside. I'll deal with him.

42:54.520 --> 42:56.320
Is Su Miao back? I need to see Su Miao.

42:56.400 --> 42:57.440
Su Miao's not here.

42:57.520 --> 42:59.480
Please stop coming here to look for her.

43:02.040 --> 43:03.400
Su Miao's shoes are here.

43:10.040 --> 43:11.280
She is here,

43:12.640 --> 43:14.320
but she can't see you right now.
You should go home.

43:15.880 --> 43:17.120
What's going on?

43:17.960 --> 43:19.240
Is she in some kind of trouble?

43:19.920 --> 43:21.480
I won't leave until I see her today.

43:22.520 --> 43:25.200
Su Miao is fine. Nothing's wrong with her.

43:25.280 --> 43:26.600
Everything is fine.

43:27.120 --> 43:28.320
If everything's fine,

43:28.400 --> 43:30.080
why did she suddenly jump into the lake?

43:31.360 --> 43:32.880
She… She had a relapse.

43:37.440 --> 43:38.720
Su Miao had a relapse?

43:40.120 --> 43:40.960
What's the problem?

43:49.960 --> 43:51.040
Hemorrhoids.

43:55.200 --> 43:56.840
Yes, hemorrhoids.

43:56.920 --> 43:59.800
It suddenly flared up,
and she couldn't stand it,

43:59.880 --> 44:01.960
but she was too embarrassed to tell you,

44:02.600 --> 44:04.240
so she jumped into the lake to escape.

44:08.280 --> 44:09.720
Hemorrhoids?

44:10.480 --> 44:12.160
Why can she eat spicy crayfish then?

44:13.960 --> 44:14.840
How do you know that?

44:14.920 --> 44:16.520
I smelled it.

44:17.320 --> 44:19.320
You got it on your hands
when you opened the box.

44:26.640 --> 44:28.200
It was me who ate it.

44:28.280 --> 44:29.640
Su Miao just watched me.

44:32.080 --> 44:34.120
Your face still has needle marks
for hyaluronic acid injections.

44:34.200 --> 44:35.360
Can you eat spicy food?

44:39.560 --> 44:41.440
I'm really worried about Su Miao.

44:42.840 --> 44:44.000
Please let me see her.

44:45.360 --> 44:47.400
I just want to know if she's safe.

44:54.080 --> 44:54.920
Su Miao!
